...\necho ========================================================\ntimeout /t 3\n","Description":"Update free_ports.bat with self-elevation and clean PowerShell killing","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/scripts/free_ports.bat","toolAction":"Update free_ports.bat","toolSummary":"Make free_ports.bat auto-elevating"}}]}
