{"step_index":6601,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-24T11:01:34Z","thinking":"Old CSS is located within specific lines of the indicated file. Proceeding to update the file to incorporate the Zero-Scroll Dashboard's styling. The CSS for `.badge-pill.status-warning` and the zero-scroll layout for `#screen-servers` will be integrated by replacing the existing content.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Replace AI Servers CSS with Zero-Scroll Dashboard styling","EndLine":1180,"Instruction":"Update CSS with zero-scroll responsive styles for screen-servers and terminal","ReplacementContent":"/* -------------------- AI SERVERS MANAGEMENT SCREEN (ZERO-SCROLL DASHBOARD) -------------------- */\n#screen-servers {\n    height: calc(100vh - 110px);\n    max-height: calc(100vh - 110px);\n    overflow: hidden !important;\n    display: none;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n#screen-servers.active {\n    display: flex;\n}\n\n.servers-dashboard-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 14px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n.dashboard-header-title {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n.dashboard-header-title i {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    color: var(--primary);\n}\n.dashboard-header-title h2 {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n}\n.dashboard-header-title span {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n.active-switcher-container {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.switcher-label {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(-